SUMMARY:GTApreneurs September 29\, 2026 Vaughan Business Networking Event
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Women in Business Networking Group (TWIB)\n\\*\\*To at
 tend\, you must **PURCHASE A TICKET** here: https://gtapreneurs.com/networ
 king-events-vaughan\n\nJoin us at an exciting Business Networking Event in
  Vaughan (1 block north of Toronto) on Tuesday September 29 where you can 
 meet potential clients and referral partners\, learn something new\, enjoy
  a meal and promote your business!\n\n* **EVENT TIME:** 5:00-8:00pm\n* **F
 OOD SERVED:** 5:00-6:00pm\n* **VENUE:** Improve Canada\, 2nd floor auditor
 ium\n* **ADDRESS:** 7250 Keele St\, Vaughan\, ON (Between Steeles Ave W. a
 nd 407)\n* **PARKING:** Free\, onsite. Park on the NORTH SIDE of the build
 ing off of Snidercroft Rd\n\n**\\*\\*DIRECTIONS TO FIND THE ROOM:** Walk t
 hrough entrance M\, go straight ahead until you get to the main aisle. Str
 aight ahead will be a staircase. If you prefer to take the elevator\, make
  a right at the main aisle\, go down a few stores and you will see it on t
 he left.\n\n**EVENT ITINERARY:**\n\n* **5:00-6:00pm:** Open networking\, f
 ood buffet\, visit exhibitor booths\n* **6:00-6:10pm:** GTApreneurs welcom
 ing presentation\n* **6:10-6:30pm:** Guest Speaker Presentation: Muhammad 
 Khan\, ***"Cash Is King\, Forecasting Is the Crown: Protecting Your Busine
 ss From Cash Crunches"***\n* **6:30-7:00pm:** Exhibitor Introductions + me
 mber Elevator Pitches\n* **7:00-8:00pm:** Open networking\, visit exhibito
 r booths\n\n**TICKETS**\n\n* **GTApreneurs' Referral Group\, Exhibitor and
  Mega Networking Members:** Free\n* **Non-members:** $25 in advance or $29
  on event day\n\nNot a GTApreneurs Member? Go here to view our memberships
  and register: https://gtapreneurs.com/business-networking-memberships\n\n
 **QUESTIONS ABOUT THE EVENT?**\nCall or text **Tammy** at (416) 522-7770 o
 r info@gtapreneurs.com.\n\nThis event will feature Guest Speaker **Muhamma
 d Khan**\, CEO & Founder\, CFOs in Action. Muhammad is the principal of CF
 Os In Action\, a premier Fractional CFO firm in Canada. Specializing in ca
 sh flow forecasting and strategic growth\, Muhammad empowers manufacturing
 \, construction and service businesses to master their finances\, optimize
  cash flow and scale confidently in complex business environments. Muhamma
 d equips leaders with the financial foresight needed to protect and grow t
 heir bottom line.\n\nContact **Muhammad** at (647) 407-9097 and visit www.
 cfosinaction.com to learn more about his services.\n\n**EXHIBITORS:**\n\n*
  **Sonia Kurmey**\, Arbonne\, www.soniakurmey.arbonne.com\n* **Balbir Pabi
 la**\, PPLSI\\~LegalShield\, https://bkpabila.legalshieldassociate.com\n* 
 **Abhishek Basak**\, Clerk Tech\, www.clerk-tech.com\n* **Brian Pho**\, Oa
 sis LLP\, www.oasisllp.ca\n* **Anne Bloom\,** Flourless and Flavourful\, w
 ww.instagram.com/flourlessandflavourful\n* **Ashifa Alibhai\,** AHANSA Leg
 al and Mediation Services\, www.ahansamediationservices.com\n* **Jenit Bil
 akhia\,** The Scroll Studio\, www.thescrollstudio.com\n\n**\\*Want to stan
 d out?** Visit www.gtapreneurs.com/exhibitor to book your exhibitor table\
 n\n\\*We will EMAIL you the GUEST CONTACT SHEET the day after the event by
  5pm. If you don’t receive it in your inbox\, please check your SPAM/JUN
 K folder. Note: You must attend the event to receive the guest contact she
 et.\n\n**Want 1-1 help with your business?** Learn about Tammy Defoe's bus
 iness coaching services here: https://gtapreneurs.com/about and https://gt
 apreneurs.com/business-coaching-toronto\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\n**DISCLAIMERS**\n\n* **Event Ph
 oto and Video Disclaimer:** By registering for and/or attending GTApreneur
 s (“Us” and “Our” and “We”) Events\, you give Us consent to us
 e your image and/or video for Our publications\, advertising and/or other 
 media activities (including the Internet).\n* **Information Sharing:** By 
 registering for or attending a GTApreneurs networking event\, you are agre
 eing to share your name\, professional title\, organization name\, city\, 
 website (if given) and LinkedIn URL (if given) with the other event attend
 ees who attend that event. If you indicate in your registration form that 
 you give Us permission to share your phone number and/or your email addres
 s with the other event attendees\, we will share the information you give 
 Us permission to share. If you indicate in the registration form that you 
 don’t give Us permission to share your phone number and/or your email ad
 dress with the other attendees\, We will not share it with the other atten
 dees. GTApreneurs will never share your home address with anyone.\n* **Eve
 nt Guest Contact Sheet:** If you don’t attend an event\, you will not be
  given the guest contact sheet and your name or other information will not
  appear on the sheet.
