SUMMARY:GTApreneurs October 14-2026 Afternoon Virtual Business Networking 
 Event Toronto
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Women in Business Networking Group (TWIB)\n\\*\\*You n
 eed to register on our website to attend this event and get the link. RSVP
 ing on Meetup does not mean that you are registered\, even though Meetup.c
 om will send you an email saying that you have. Thank you. Please go here:
  https://gtapreneurs.com/networking-events-toronto\n\n\\*Please note this 
 event is advertised on multiple platforms\, and we expect around 20-25 gue
 sts.\n\nDo you want more clients? Join us for GTApreneurs October 14-2026 
 Afternoon Virtual Business Networking Event to connect with other amazing 
 entrepreneurs\, learn something new and promote your business!\n\n**WARM-U
 P ITINERARY:**\n\n* **[11:45am-12pm: Pre-event networking]**\n* **12:00-12
 :10pm:** GTApreneurs welcoming presentation\n* **12:10-12:30pm:** Tammy De
 foe Presentation\, ***“You Never Get a 2nd Chance to Make a 1st Impressi
 on?”***\n* **12:30-1:00pm:** Elevator Pitches (45 seconds each)\nFree\n\
 n**PREMIUM EVENT ITINERARY:**\n\n* **[11:45am-12pm: Pre-event networking]*
 *\n* **12:00-12:10pm:** GTApreneurs welcoming presentation\n* **12:10-12:3
 0pm:** Tammy Defoe Presentation\, ***“You Never Get a 2nd Chance to Make
  a 1st Impression?”***\n* **12:30-1:00pm:** Elevator Pitches (45 seconds
  each)\n* **1:00-2:00pm:** Breakout rooms (Network 1-1 with other guests)\
 n\n**TICKETS**\n**GTApreneurs' Referral Group\, Exhibitor and Mega Network
 ing Members:** Free\n**Non-members:** $10\n\\*Premium ticket includes Gues
 t Contact sheet emailed to you after the event. Note: You must attend the 
 event to receive the guest contact sheet.\n\nThis event will feature our P
 resident of GTApreneurs\, **Tammy Defoe**\, who excels at helping entrepre
 neurs get more exposure and more clients. She is a Business Coach and Cons
 ultant specializing in business development\, sales\, marketing\, digital 
