 sit https://gtapreneurs.com/about and https://gtapreneurs.com/business-coa
 ching-toronto for more information about Tammy and her Business Coaching a
 nd Consulting services.\n\n**QUESTIONS ABOUT THE EVENT?**\nContact **Tammy
 ** at (416) 522-7770 or info@gtapreneurs.com or book a video consultation 
 with her here: https://calendly.com/gtapreneurs\n\nWant to attend the Prem
 ium version of our Virtual Networking Events for FREE? Become a Member. Le
 arn more at https://gtapreneurs.com/business-networking-memberships
