SUMMARY:GTApreneurs' October 15\, 2026 Speed Business Networking Event in 
 Ajax
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Women in Business Networking Group (TWIB)\n\\*\\*To at
 tend\, you must **PURCHASE A TICKET** here: https://gtapreneurs.com/busine
 ss-networking-events-pickering\n\nJoin us for an exciting Business Network
 ing Event at Portly Piper Pub Ajax on Thursday October 15\, 2026 where you
  can mix n mingle with other friendly entrepreneurs and small business own
 ers and engage in 3-minute intervals of Speed Networking! This is an outst
 anding opportunity for you to meet potential clients and referral partners
  and promote your business.\n\n***Appetizers provided. \\*Cash bar.***\n\n
 This is casual\, social networking event where you can stand or sit to con
 nect with new people or with familiar faces. We will start with ice breake
 rs to ease into the open networking. We will provide you with a Guest Cont
 act Sheet by 5pm the day after the day\, but\, bring your business cards t
 o share too. It will help those you meet to remember you.\n\n* **TIME:** 6
 :00-8:00pm\n* **VENUE:** Portly Piper Pub Ajax\n* **ADDRESS:** 235 Bayly S
 t W\, Ajax\, ON\n* **PARKING:** Free\, onsite\, park in front of the main 
 entrance\n\n**EVENT ITINERARY:**\n\n* **6:00-7:00pm:** Open networking + a
 ppetizers + buy your own beverage\n* **7:00-8:00pm:** 1-1 Speed networking
  (3 minutes/pair then rotate)\n\n**TICKETS**\n\n* **GTApreneurs' Referral 
 Group\, Exhibitor and Mega Networking Members:** Free\n* **Non-members:** 
 $22 in advance or $25 on event day\n\n**QUESTIONS ABOUT THE EVENT?**\nCall
  or text **Yolande** at 705-710-9026 or email mmlf-info@consultant.com\n\n
 Not a GTApreneurs Member? Go here to view our memberships and register: ht
 tps://gtapreneurs.com/business-networking-memberships
