 capital doesn’t – yet”***\n* **11:40-12:00pm: Muhammad Murtaza Khan*
 * presentation\, ***“Stop Guessing\, Start Growing: The Strategic Power 
 of Cash Flow Forecasting.”***\n* **12:15- 2:00pm:** VIP Lunch\n* **1:00-
 4:30pm:** BizX 2026 Business Expo (Main expo room)\n* **2:30-2:50pm:** **B
 runo Teixeira** presentation\, ***"Where does AI actually save you hours?
 ”***\n* **2:50-3:10pm:** **Helen Ching** presentation\, ***“Early bird
  gets the worm. Early planning accumulates significant business wealth.”
 ***\n* **4:30-5:00pm:** *Awards Ceremony:* ***Draw and awards*** given for
  **door prizes\, BizX 2026 Expo Contest and Exhibitor Draw**\n\n\\*\\*Snac
 ks and refreshments served 1:00-4:30pm\n\n**VIP Ticket:**\n\n* $59 regular
  or $49 before August 31\, 2026\n* GTApreneurs' Referral Group\, Exhibitor
  and Mega Networking Members: Free\n\n**Not a member?** Join us today >> [
 https://gtapreneurs.com/business-networking-memberships](https://gtapreneu
 rs.com/business-networking-memberships)\n\n**Book an exhibitor table at Bi
 zX 2026\,** click here >> [https://gtapreneurs.com/product/bizx2026-busine
 ss-expo-exhibitor](https://gtapreneurs.com/product/bizx2026-business-expo-
 exhibitor)\n\n**Sponsor BizX 2026**\, send us a message >> info@gtapreneur
 s.com\n\n**DOOR PRIZE RAFFLE:** Bring your business card and drop it in th
 e box for a chance to win a great prize.\n\n**BIZX 2026 BUSINESS EXPO CONT
 EST:** Each time you visit an exhibitor\, and exchange business cards (or 
 exchange information electronically)\, they will put a sticker on your eve
 nt map. Fill your map with a sticker from every exhibitor to win a prize. 
 At the end of the day (4:30-5:00pm)\, we will announce Expo Contest winner
 s as well as guest door prize winners and exhibitor draw winners.\n\n**SPO
 NSORED BY:**\n\n* **Sonia Kurmey\,** Arbonne\, [www.soniakurmey.arbonne.co
 m](https://www.soniakurmey.arbonne.com/)\n* **Balbir Pabila\,** PPLSI\\~Le
 galShield\, [https://bkpabila.legalshieldassociate.com](https://bkpabila.l
 egalshieldassociate.com/)\n* **Michelina Dos Santos and Sonya Sokoliuk\,**
  The Mortgage Coach\, [https://themortgagecoach.ca](https://themortgagecoa
 ch.ca/)\n* **Dana Thomson\,** ADP\, [www.adp.com](www.adp.com)\n* **Svetla
 na Ratnikova\,** IWB Immigrant Women in Business\, [https://immigrantwomen
 inbusiness.com](https://immigrantwomeninbusiness.com)\n* **Nile Saïd\,** 
 GoOneUp\, [https://gooneup.co](https://gooneup.co/)\n* **Angie Nezarati\,*
 * Everyday Business\, [https://everydaybusiness.ca](https://everydaybusine
 ss.ca/)\n* **Muhammad Khan\,** CFOs in Action\, [www.cfosinaction.com](htt
 ps://www.cfosinaction.com/)\n* **Bruno Teixeira\,** Aegis AI & Analytics A
 dvisory\, [https://aegisaianalytics.ca](https://aegisaianalytics.ca/)\n* *
 *Helen Ching\,** Monai Wealth\, [www.monaiwealth.com](https://www.monaiwea
 lth.com/)\n\n**DISCLAIMERS**\n***Event Photo and Video Disclaimer:*** By r
 egistering for and/or attending GTApreneurs (“Us” and “Our” and 
 “We”) Events\, you give Us consent to use your image and/or video for 
 Our publications\, advertising and/or other media activities (including th
 e Internet).\n\n***Information Sharing:*** By registering for or attending
  a GTApreneurs networking event\, you are agreeing to share your name\, pr
 ofessional title\, organization name\, city\, website (if given) and Linke
 dIn URL (if given) with the other people who attend this event. If you ind
 icate in your registration form that you give Us permission to share your 
 phone number and/or your email address with the other event attendees\, we
  will share the information you give Us permission to share. If you indica
 te in the registration form that you don’t give Us permission to share y
 our phone number and/or your email address with the other attendees\, We w
 ill not share it with the other attendees. GTApreneurs will never share yo
 ur home address with anyone.\n\n***Event Guest Contact Sheet:*** Your tick
 et does not include the Guest or Exhibitor Contact Sheets.
